  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-AU\">Our business started off as a &ldquo;farm-to-fork&rdquo; project, born out of a love for the St Davids Peninsula. We celebrate the local environment and ingredients found here.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-AU\">In 2016 we opened St Davids Gin &amp; Kitchen a 36 cover restaurant. We&rsquo;re vertically-integrated, rearing our own cattle &amp; pork locally and sourcing the vast majority of our food from the peninsula<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-AU\">As a family business, we&rsquo;ve been based in the St Davids area for at least 8 generations - and appeared on the first 1801 census. We&rsquo;re passionate about the local area, committed to creating good quality, well-paid jobs and giving back to the community.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-AU\">ST DAVIDS GIN LIMITED was establised in January 2019 and it was a natural progression from what we had achieved with the restaurant to build a Priemium Spirits brand. We currently have 5 products, 3 x Gins (Our award winning St Davids Dry, Ramsey sland &amp; Seaweed Editions), St Davids Spiced Seaweed Rum &amp; St Davids Premium Vodka.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-AU\">We have a partnership &amp; support the <b>RSPB with our Gin products&nbsp;</b>We also support our local <b>RNLI </b>station through the sales of our St Davids Rum.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-AU\"></span>PAYMENTS WILL BE A MONTHLY IN ARREARS</p>",
